  "description": "<p>Welcome to&nbsp;<strong>Detroit Nail Assassin</strong>, where beauty meets convenience. With years of expertise in the nail industry, we bring you innovative, high-quality press-on nail solutions designed to empower self-expression through artful nail designs.</p>\r\n<p>Indulge in salon-quality nails with our comprehensive&nbsp;<strong>24-piece press-on nail set</strong>. Perfect for achieving a flawless, professional look in minutes, this kit ensures durability, style, and ease of use&mdash;all in one package.</p>\r\n<h4>USP (Unique Selling Point):</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Custom Fit</strong>: Includes 12 sizes to guarantee the perfect fit for every finger.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Durability and Reusability</strong>: Strong enough for multiple uses while maintaining a professional finish.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Complete Kit</strong>: Comes with nail glue, sticky tabs, nail file, and cuticle pusher for hassle-free application and removal.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Versatile Styles</strong>: Wide range of designs to match any outfit, mood, or occasion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Payment Terms:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>We accept <strong>credit cards, debit cards, PayPal, and all major payment gateways</strong> for secure and convenient payments.</li>\r\n<li>Custom or bulk orders require a 50% deposit upon placement and full payment before delivery.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Other Information:</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Shipping</strong>: Free shipping on orders over $20 within the USA.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Returns</strong>: Returns are <strong>only accepted for orders placed through TikTok Shop</strong>. All other sales are final.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Care Instructions</strong>: To prolong the life of your nails, avoid prolonged exposure to water and use a top coat for added shine and protection.</li>\r\n</ul>",
